Cu, Co, Ni, Pb and As have been reported in River Nyamwamba near the copper mine in Kilembe, Western Uganda;
Abraham and Susan (2017), while Zhiyuan et al. (2014) also
reviewed the pollution of heavy metals in soils in China and
